WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.722
A fraction describes equal parts of one whole.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:21.424
The bottom number tells how many equal parts make the whole; the top number tells how

00:00:21.424 --> 00:00:29.106
many parts we have. To add fractions, first rename them with the same bottom number.

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:40.243
For one third plus two fifths, fifteenths work: five fifteenths plus six fifteenths

00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:42.754
equals eleven fifteenths.
